      "writtenOn": "2024-12-03T01:41:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this seen as a violation with a dependency on system ? both framework-connectivity-t and framework-connectivity-pre-jarjar are apex_available for \"com.android.tethering\" only, they should only be used for the APEX and not part of the non-updatable system.\n\nIs there a bug/limitation in the checker ?",
      "revId": "ce544f725b16ec51e849fabb333cbf55ee186d87",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
